<li data-start="2116" data-end="2377">
<p data-start="2119" data-end="2377"><strong data-start="2119" data-end="2144">Using the Interpreter</strong>:<br data-start="2145" data-end="2148">
With this basic interpreter, you can now create a few spheres and merge them to see the resulting transformations. This is the core of how you could represent semantic modules and their interactions in the PlenumHub prototype.</p>
