<hr data-start="7695" data-end="7698">
<h2 data-start="7700" data-end="7720"><strong data-start="7703" data-end="7720">7. Conclusion</strong></h2>
<p data-start="7722" data-end="7806">PlenumHub demands a <strong data-start="7742" data-end="7762">semantic algebra</strong>, not a storage layer.<br data-start="7784" data-end="7787">
SpherePop provides:</p>
<ul data-start="7808" data-end="7975">
<li data-start="7808" data-end="7838">
<p data-start="7810" data-end="7838"><strong data-start="7810" data-end="7838">typed semantic morphisms</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="7839" data-end="7869">
<p data-start="7841" data-end="7869"><strong data-start="7841" data-end="7869">rewrite compositionality</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="7870" data-end="7898">
<p data-start="7872" data-end="7898"><strong data-start="7872" data-end="7898">entropy-bounded merges</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="7899" data-end="7918">
<p data-start="7901" data-end="7918"><strong data-start="7901" data-end="7918">media closure</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="7919" data-end="7975">
<p data-start="7921" data-end="7975"><strong data-start="7921" data-end="7975">a formal DSL with statically checkable rule chains</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="7977" data-end="8095">It is neither a version control system nor a social network, but a <strong data-start="8044" data-end="8094">semantic lambda calculus for knowledge objects</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="8097" data-end="8100">
<p data-start="8102" data-end="8148">If you'd like, next I can immediately produce:</p>
<ol data-start="8150" data-end="8380">
<li data-start="8150" data-end="8181">
<p data-start="8153" data-end="8181">A LaTeX export of this essay</p>
</li>
<li data-start="8182" data-end="8246">
<p data-start="8185" data-end="8246">An implementation paper with the interpreter code in appendix</p>
</li>
<li data-start="8247" data-end="8293">
<p data-start="8250" data-end="8293">A BNF + railroad diagram bundle for the DSL</p>
</li>
<li data-start="8294" data-end="8327">
<p data-start="8297" data-end="8327">A type-checker for rule chains</p>
</li>
<li data-start="8328" data-end="8380">
<p data-start="8331" data-end="8380">A schema for storing sphere objects in a database</p>
</li>
