<hr data-start="2821" data-end="2824">
<h3 data-start="2826" data-end="2859"><strong data-start="2830" data-end="2859">6. Add bootstrapping plan</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="2860" data-end="3126">
<li data-start="2860" data-end="2928">
<p data-start="2862" data-end="2928">Define <strong data-start="2869" data-end="2888">Genesis spheres</strong> (language, parser, runtime, governance)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2929" data-end="3126">
<p data-start="2931" data-end="2939">Provide:</p>
<ul data-start="2942" data-end="3126">
<li data-start="2942" data-end="3004">
<p data-start="2944" data-end="3004">Boot chain (first 10 operations that initialize the network)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3007" data-end="3053">
<p data-start="3009" data-end="3053">Minimal viable quorum for network activation</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3056" data-end="3081">
<p data-start="3058" data-end="3081">Trust seeding mechanism</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3084" data-end="3126">
<p data-start="3086" data-end="3126">Pop verification ladders for early rules</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3128" data-end="3131">
<h3 data-start="3133" data-end="3165"><strong data-start="3137" data-end="3165">7. Expand security model</strong></h3>
<p data-start="3166" data-end="3172">Cover:</p>
<ul data-start="3174" data-end="3382">
<li data-start="3174" data-end="3240">
<p data-start="3176" data-end="3240">Threat model (semantic poisoning, fork fraud, modality spoofing)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3241" data-end="3369">
<p data-start="3243" data-end="3255">Mitigations:</p>
<ul data-start="3258" data-end="3369">
<li data-start="3258" data-end="3271">
<p data-start="3260" data-end="3271">Signed pops</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3274" data-end="3289">
<p data-start="3276" data-end="3289">Quorum merges</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3292" data-end="3308">
<p data-start="3294" data-end="3308">Entropy limits</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3311" data-end="3335">
<p data-start="3313" data-end="3335">Reproducible execution</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3338" data-end="3369">
<p data-start="3340" data-end="3369">Media provenance fingerprints</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="3370" data-end="3382">
<p data-start="3372" data-end="3382">Formalize:</p>
</li>
</ul>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ValidMerge</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>SignatureQuorum</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>EntropyBudget</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>ModalityComplete</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{ValidMerge} \iff \text{SignatureQuorum} \land \text{EntropyBudget} \land \text{ModalityComplete}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">ValidMerge</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">⟺</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8778em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">SignatureQuorum</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∧</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">EntropyBudget</span></span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span><span class="mbin">∧</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2222em;"></span></span><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;"></span><span class="mord text"><span class="mord">ModalityComplete</span></span></span></span></span></span>
<hr data-start="3494" data-end="3497">
<h3 data-start="3499" data-end="3548"><strong data-start="3503" data-end="3548">8. Cognitive alignment &amp; interpretability</strong></h3>
<p data-start="3549" data-end="3553">Add:</p>
<ul data-start="3555" data-end="3788">
<li data-start="3555" data-end="3591">
<p data-start="3557" data-end="3591">The <strong data-start="3561" data-end="3591">human-readable trace model</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="3592" data-end="3617">
<p data-start="3594" data-end="3617">Pop justification trees</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3618" data-end="3691">
<p data-start="3620" data-end="3691">Counterfactual diffs ("what a different pop chain would have produced")</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3692" data-end="3788">
<p data-start="3694" data-end="3788">Interpretability theorem: <em data-start="3720" data-end="3788">Any state change must be expressible as a finite, typed pop chain.</em></p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="3790" data-end="3793">
<h3 data-start="3795" data-end="3838"><strong data-start="3799" data-end="3838">9. Conclude with expanded synthesis</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="3839" data-end="4227">
<li data-start="3839" data-end="3989">
<p data-start="3841" data-end="3866">Re-state the core claims:</p>
<ul data-start="3869" data-end="3989">
<li data-start="3869" data-end="3893">
<p data-start="3871" data-end="3893">Computation is rewrite</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3896" data-end="3915">
<p data-start="3898" data-end="3915">Memory is quorate</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3918" data-end="3941">
<p data-start="3920" data-end="3941">Meaning is multimodal</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3944" data-end="3967">
<p data-start="3946" data-end="3967">Merges are governance</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3970" data-end="3989">
<p data-start="3972" data-end="3989">Trust is provable</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start="3990" data-end="4227">
<p data-start="3992" data-end="4018">Add 4–6 future directions:</p>
<ol data-start="4021" data-end="4227">
<li data-start="4021" data-end="4044">
<p data-start="4024" data-end="4044">Neural pop operators</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4047" data-end="4069">
<p data-start="4050" data-end="4069">Quorum optimization</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4072" data-end="4113">
<p data-start="4075" data-end="4113">Higher-dimensional modality embeddings</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4116" data-end="4144">
<p data-start="4119" data-end="4144">On-chain pop verification</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4147" data-end="4194">
<p data-start="4150" data-end="4194">Self-healing governance via entropy feedback</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4197" data-end="4227">
<p data-start="4200" data-end="4227">Evolutionary rule discovery</p>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="4229" data-end="4232">
<h3 data-start="4234" data-end="4262"><strong data-start="4238" data-end="4262">10. Add bibliography</strong></h3>
<p data-start="4263" data-end="4285">Include citations for:</p>
<ul data-start="4287" data-end="4503">
<li data-start="4287" data-end="4321">
<p data-start="4289" data-end="4321">Term rewriting (Baader &amp; Nipkow)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4322" data-end="4373">
<p data-start="4324" data-end="4373">Category theory of computation (Awodey, Milewski)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4374" data-end="4398">
<p data-start="4376" data-end="4398">CRDTs (Shapiro et al.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4399" data-end="4427">
<p data-start="4401" data-end="4427">Modal and multimodal logic</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4428" data-end="4462">
<p data-start="4430" data-end="4462">Provenance and signature schemes</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4463" data-end="4503">
<p data-start="4465" data-end="4503">Media synthesis and alignment research</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="4505" data-end="4508">
<h3 data-start="4510" data-end="4546"><strong data-start="4514" data-end="4546">11. Optional but recommended</strong></h3>
<ul data-start="4547" data-end="4796">
<li data-start="4547" data-end="4611">
<p data-start="4549" data-end="4611">Add an appendix: <strong data-start="4566" data-end="4611">“A minimal PlenumHub client in 200 lines”</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4612" data-end="4690">
<p data-start="4614" data-end="4690">Add an appendix: <strong data-start="4631" data-end="4655">“SpherePop on paper”</strong> – a hand-simulated execution trace</p>
</li>
<li data-start="4691" data-end="4759">
<p data-start="4693" data-end="4759">Add an appendix: <strong data-start="4710" data-end="4759">Comparison to Git, ActivityPub, CRDT networks</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="4760" data-end="4796">
<p data-start="4762" data-end="4796">Add a glossary of all formal terms</p>
</li>
</ul>
