<p data-start="551" data-end="596">These should be merged into one clean opener.</p>
<h3 data-start="598" data-end="651">3. <strong data-start="605" data-end="649">Appendix A is defined after bibliography</strong></h3>
<p data-start="652" data-end="730">It should appear <strong data-start="669" data-end="679">before</strong> <code data-start="680" data-end="705">\begin{thebibliography}</code> for clean PDF structure.</p>
