<h1 data-start="1338" data-end="1380"><strong data-start="1340" data-end="1380">II. Scientific Content Still Missing</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="1382" data-end="1429">1. <strong data-start="1389" data-end="1429">A formal complexity analysis theorem</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1430" data-end="1452">Add a theorem such as:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>pop</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext>merge</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>med</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo separator="true">,</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">O(\text{pop}) = O(n_r), \quad
O(\text{merge}) = O(C_{\text{med}}), \quad
