<h3 data-start="1883" data-end="1929">3. <strong data-start="1890" data-end="1929">A Figure (optional but recommended)</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1930" data-end="2021">Not a diagram — a <strong data-start="1948" data-end="1980">commutative reduction square</strong> or <strong data-start="1984" data-end="2001">merge lattice</strong> in math form, e.g.:</p>
