<h1 data-start="2186" data-end="2224"><strong data-start="2188" data-end="2224">III. New Sections You Should Add</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start="2226" data-end="2283"><strong data-start="2230" data-end="2283">Add after §2: “Category and Algebraic Properties”</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2285" data-end="2293">Include:</p>
<ul data-start="2295" data-end="2447">
<li data-start="2295" data-end="2347">
<p data-start="2297" data-end="2347">Pop forms a <strong data-start="2309" data-end="2330">monoidal category</strong> under sequencing</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2348" data-end="2410">
<p data-start="2350" data-end="2410">Merge is a <strong data-start="2361" data-end="2391">partial commutative monoid</strong> with entropy bound</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2411" data-end="2447">
<p data-start="2413" data-end="2447">Closure is an <strong data-start="2427" data-end="2447">idempotent monad</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
