<hr data-start="2648" data-end="2651">
<h3 data-start="2653" data-end="2720"><strong data-start="2657" data-end="2720">Add before Security: “Governance, Forking, and Convergence”</strong></h3>
<p data-start="2722" data-end="2730">Explain:</p>
<ul data-start="2732" data-end="2949">
<li data-start="2732" data-end="2795">
<p data-start="2734" data-end="2795">Forks live in the same space, but must satisfy entropy bounds</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2796" data-end="2892">
<p data-start="2798" data-end="2892">Reconciliation reduces to finding a <strong data-start="2834" data-end="2862">bounded mirror transform</strong> <span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 0.6887em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.00773em;">R</span><span class="msupsub"><span class="vlist-t"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.6887em;"><span style="top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mbin mtight">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> minimizing divergence</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2893" data-end="2949">
<p data-start="2895" data-end="2949">No branch may grow entropy without paying crystal cost</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2951" data-end="2971">Equation to include:</p>
