afely paste into your draft:</p>
<hr data-start="131" data-end="134">
<p data-start="136" data-end="157"><strong data-start="136" data-end="157">Replace this row:</strong></p>
<p data-start="159" data-end="227">| Model hallucinated modalities | Whitelisted modality transducers |</p>
<p data-start="229" data-end="243"><strong data-start="229" data-end="243">With this:</strong></p>
<p data-start="245" data-end="315">| Model hallucinated modalities | <strong data-start="279" data-end="292">Permitted</strong> modality transducers |</p>
<hr data-start="317" data-end="320">
<p data-start="322" data-end="360">And in prose, replace any instance of:</p>
<blockquote data-start="362" data-end="398">
<p data-start="364" data-end="398"><em data-start="364" data-end="398">whitelisted modality transducers</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="400" data-end="405">with:</p>
<blockquote data-start="407" data-end="443">
<p data-start="409" data-end="443"><strong data-start="409" data-end="443">permitted modality transducers</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start="445" data-end="490">or when you want a slightly more formal tone:</p>
<blockquote data-start="492" data-end="539">
<p data-start="494" data-end="539"><strong data-start="494" data-end="539">explicitly permitted modality transducers</strong></p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="541" data-end="544">
<p data-start="546" data-end="636">If you want, here are three stylistic variants you can use in different parts of the text:</p>
<div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div tabindex="-1" class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse"><table data-start="638" data-end="873" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="638" data-end="667"><tr data-start="638" data-end="667"><th data-start="638" data-end="645" data-col-size="sm">Tone</th><th data-start="645" data-end="667" data-col-size="md">Replacement phrase</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="678" data-end="873"><tr data-start="678" data-end="724"><td data-start="678" data-end="690" data-col-size="sm">Technical</td><td data-start="690" data-end="724" data-col-size="md">permitted modality transducers</td></tr><tr data-start="725" data-end="788"><td data-start="725" data-end="743" data-col-size="sm">Formal/academic</td><td data-start="743" data-end="788" data-col-size="md">explicitly permitted modality transducers</td></tr><tr data-start="789" data-end="873"><td data-start="789" data-end="817" data-col-size="sm">Systems/security-oriented</td><td data-start="817" data-end="873" data-col-size="md">access-controlled and permitted modality transducers</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.