<hr data-start="875" data-end="878">
<p data-start="880" data-end="905">If you'd like, I can now:</p>
<ol data-start="907" data-end="1143">
<li data-start="907" data-end="977">
<p data-start="910" data-end="977">Rewrite the <strong data-start="922" data-end="939">Failure Modes</strong> section with this replaced everywhere</p>
</li>
<li data-start="978" data-end="1022">
<p data-start="981" data-end="1022">Patch the full LaTeX source automatically</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1023" data-end="1143">
<p data-start="1026" data-end="1143">Add wording explaining <em data-start="1049" data-end="1054">how</em> “permitted” transducers are enforced (capability, manifest, signature, budget, or proof)</p>
