<p data-start="6212" data-end="6243">All notation defined before use</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6244" data-end="6291">
<p data-start="6246" data-end="6291">No informal argument without formal surrogate</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6292" data-end="6362">
<p data-start="6294" data-end="6362">Consistent symbols (σ for spheres, R for rules, E for entropy, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="6363" data-end="6401">
<p data-start="6365" data-end="6401">Equations are numbered if referenced</p>
</li>
</ul>
