</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\centering</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{tabular}{ll}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\toprule</span></span><span>
Structure </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span> Meaning in PlenumHub </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\midrule</span></span><span>
Category </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\mathbf</span></span><span>{Sph}</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span> Typed, composable semantic evolution </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
Monoidal tensor </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\otimes</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span> Parallel sphere evolution </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
Partial monoid </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\oplus</span></span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span> Entropy-bounded semantic merge </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
Reflector </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span>Q</span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">$</span></span><span> </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span> Canonical modality completion </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
Equivariance laws </span><span><span class="hljs-built_in">&amp;</span></span><span> Symmetry preservation in meaning </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\\</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\bottomrule</span></span><span>
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{tabular}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\caption</span></span><span>{Categorical properties and their semantic interpretations.}
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{table}

This categorical backbone ensures that PlenumHub is not merely a data system, but a lawful </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\emph</span></span><span>{semantic physics} supporting compositional, symmetric, and entropy-stable knowledge evolution.

