t me to produce?</p>
<p data-start="44" data-end="132">You have four options and you said <em data-start="79" data-end="96">“The insertion”</em> — but I need to know <strong data-start="118" data-end="131">which one</strong>:</p>
<p data-start="134" data-end="454"><strong data-start="134" data-end="141">A1.</strong> String diagram visualization of sphere morphisms<br data-start="190" data-end="193">
<strong data-start="193" data-end="200">A2.</strong> Explicit construction of the free symmetric monoidal category generated by rule morphisms<br data-start="290" data-end="293">
