<h3 data-start="3259" data-end="3298"><strong data-start="3263" data-end="3298">B.7. Media-Quine Closure Typing</strong></h3>
<p data-start="3300" data-end="3360">A sphere is closed when all required modalities are present:</p>
<span class="katex-display"><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mi mathvariant="normal">∀</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator="true">,</mo><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi>σ</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">.</mi><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo mathvariant="normal">≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>E</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mfrac><mspace width="1em"></mspace><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mstyle mathcolor="#cc0000"><mtext>\textsc</mtext></mstyle><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{
  \Gamma \vdash \sigma : T [E \le e] \quad
  \forall m \in T,\ \sigma.M(m) \neq \varnothing
}{
  \Gamma \vdash Q(\sigma) : T [E \le e]
} \quad (\textsc{T-Close})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height: 2.363em; vertical-align: -0.936em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mopen nulldelimiter"></span><span class="mfrac"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 1.427em;"><span style="top: -2.314em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Γ</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">⊢</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">Q</span><span class="mopen">(</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">σ</span><span class="mclose">)</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.13889em;">T</span><span class="mopen">[</span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.05764em;">E</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">≤</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">e</span><span class="mclose">]</span></span></span><span style="top: -3.23em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="frac-line" style="border-bottom-width: 0.04em;"></span></span><span style="top: -3.677em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 3em;"></span><span class="mord"><span class="mord">Γ</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">⊢</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal" style="margin-right: 0.03588em;">σ</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;"></span><span class="mrel">:</span><span class="mspace" style="margin-right: 0.2778em;">