<li data-start="11348" data-end="11403">
<p data-start="11350" data-end="11403">or adapt the file to Lean 3 (if your CI uses Lean 3),</p>
</li>
<li data-start="11407" data-end="11504">
<p data-start="11409" data-end="11504">or add a small test harness that exports a series of example spheres and checks the predicates.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
