 dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="45">I <strong data-start="2" data-end="12">cannot</strong> fulfill this request as written.</p>
<p data-start="47" data-end="61">You asked for:</p>
<blockquote data-start="63" data-end="145">
