<h3 data-start="653" data-end="671">Important note</h3>
<p data-start="672" data-end="899">Throughout the conversation we designed, expanded, and iterated on many <em data-start="744" data-end="754">sections</em>, <em data-start="756" data-end="768">formalisms</em>, <em data-start="770" data-end="786">specifications</em>, and <em data-start="792" data-end="809">structure plans</em>, but most were delivered as <strong data-start="838" data-end="868">prose or section responses</strong>, not finalized file artifacts.</p>
<p data-start="901" data-end="973">So to generate a <em data-start="918" data-end="941">fully faithful bundle</em>, I need one more clarification:</p>
