<h1 data-start="6309" data-end="6340">4) Lean file (plenumhub.lean)</h1>
<p data-start="6341" data-end="6387">Save as <code data-start="6349" data-end="6387">plenumhub-stage2/lean/plenumhub.lean</code></p>
<blockquote data-start="6389" data-end="6640">
<p data-start="6391" data-end="6640">NOTE: This is a conservative, portable Lean-style formalization sketch. It uses simple Lean-like syntax and deliberate minimalism so you can port it into Lean 3 or 4 + mathlib with small edits. It intentionally limits reliance on external libraries.</p>
</blockquote>
