<p data-start="10107" data-end="10393">function purchase_budget(node, eps):<br>
price = P0 * exp(alpha * global_entropy) * eps<br>
require(ledger.balance(node, "TiC") &gt;= price)<br>
ledger.transfer(node, protocol_vault, "TiC", price)<br>
protocol_vault.reserve_budget(node, eps)<br>
emit BudgetPurchased(node, eps, price)</p>
