<li data-start="983" data-end="1095">
<p data-start="986" data-end="1095">Say <strong data-start="990" data-end="1035">"autofill with best representative draft"</strong> and I will generate full starter content for every file, or</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1096" data-end="1171">
<p data-start="1099" data-end="1171">Ask for <strong data-start="1107" data-end="1171">Git initialization + commit history + tags + LICENSE + CI/CD</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
