<p data-start="1089" data-end="1147">If I generate <strong data-start="1103" data-end="1126">all of this at once</strong>, the output will be:</p>
<ul data-start="1149" data-end="1294">
<li data-start="1149" data-end="1179">
<p data-start="1151" data-end="1179">~25,000–60,000 lines of code</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1180" data-end="1220">
<p data-start="1182" data-end="1220">40–120 files across multiple languages</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1221" data-end="1251">
<p data-start="1223" data-end="1251">80–140 page LaTeX manuscript</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1252" data-end="1294">
<p data-start="1254" data-end="1294">Multiple ZIPs (one will hit size limits)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start="1296" data-end="1356">To generate correctly, I need <strong data-start="1330" data-end="1346">one decision</strong> from you:</h3>
<p data-start="1358" data-end="1396">Which style of completion do you want?</p>
<hr data-start="1398" data-end="1401">
<h3 data-start="1403" data-end="1428"><strong data-start="1407" data-end="1428">A. Research-first</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1429" data-end="1522">Full LaTeX paper + proofs + Lean + math, code stubs completed only after theory is finalized.</p>
<h3 data-start="1524" data-end="1547"><strong data-start="1528" data-end="1547">B. Engine-first</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1548" data-end="1644">Working codebase first (SpherePOP interpreter, PlenumHub server, crystal runtime), theory after.</p>
<h3 data-start="1646" data-end="1669"><strong data-start="1650" data-end="1669">C. Equal-weight</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1670" data-end="1748">Both research paper and working implementation developed together in parallel.</p>
<h3 data-start="1750" data-end="1769"><strong data-start="1754" data-end="1769">D. MVP-demo</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1770" data-end="1889">Everything trimmed to the smallest <em data-start="1805" data-end="1830">running end-to-end demo</em> (Hub + SpherePOP + crystals + one modality quine example).</p>
<h3 data-start="1891" data-end="1909"><strong data-start="1895" data-end="1909">E. Maximal</strong></h3>
<p data-start="1910" data-end="2005">The full 100% expansion of every stub into publication-grade + deployable system, no shortcuts.</p>
<hr data-start="2007" data-end="2010">
<p data-start="2012" data-end="2044">Reply with <strong data-start="2023" data-end="2043">A, B, C, D, or E</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="2046" data-end="2065">After that, I will:</p>
<ol data-start="2067" data-end="2264">
<li data-start="2067" data-end="2103">
<p data-start="2070" data-end="2103">Generate the full expanded drafts</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2104" data-end="2127">
<p data-start="2107" data-end="2127">Build the repository</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2128" data-end="2179">
<p data-start="2131" data-end="2179">Pack it into a downloadable multi-archive bundle</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2180" data-end="2220">
<p data-start="2183" data-end="2220">Provide checksums and a file manifest</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2221" data-end="2264">
<p data-start="2224" data-end="2264">Provide next-step build/run instructions</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="2266" data-end="2276" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Which one?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.16593 14.7044 3.19727 15.0879C3.22797 15.4636 3.28473 15.675 3.36524 15.833L3.43555 15.959C3.61186 16.2466 3.86474 16.4807 4.16699 16.634