<li data-start="256" data-end="291">
<p data-start="258" data-end="291">SpherePOP interpreter and grammar</p>
</li>
<li data-start="292" data-end="318">
<p data-start="294" data-end="318">Lean formalization stubs</p>
</li>
<li data-start="319" data-end="394">
<p data-start="321" data-end="394">Multi-zip bundles created earlier (paper.zip, impl.zip, proofs.zip, etc.)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="395" data-end="511">
<p data-start="397" data-end="511">Major project skeletons (RSVP, Yarncrawler, CrystalEconomy, StarsTechTree, OntologyTypes, SemanticInfrastructure…)</p>
</li>
<li data-start="512" data-end="561">
<p data-start="514" data-end="561">Manifests, checksums, and future direction docs</p>
</li>
<li data-start="562" data-end="631">
<p data-start="564" data-end="631">Every intermediate build artifact and folder created in <code data-start="620" data-end="631">/mnt/data</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="633" data-end="683">It is a <strong data-start="641" data-end="682">complete archive of the session state</strong>.</p>
