<h2 data-start="6064" data-end="6081"><strong data-start="6067" data-end="6081">10. Vision</strong></h2>
<p data-start="6083" data-end="6206">PlenumHub is not a social network, database, or version control system.<br data-start="6154" data-end="6157">
It is a <strong data-start="6165" data-end="6196">verified physics of meaning</strong> enabling:</p>
<ul data-start="6208" data-end="6396">
<li data-start="6208" data-end="6254">
