<p data-start="6330" data-end="6360"><strong data-start="6330" data-end="6360">Cross-modal memory closure</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="6361" data-end="6396">
<p data-start="6363" data-end="6396"><strong data-start="6363" data-end="6396">Disorder-priced collaboration</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="6398" data-end="6494">where knowledge grows like a <strong data-start="6427" data-end="6457">correct mathematical proof</strong>, not like an <strong data-start="6471" data-end="6493">unbounded edit log</strong>.</p>
