<p data-start="1225" data-end="1240">Reply with one:</p>
<p data-start="1242" data-end="1505">A. <strong data-start="1245" data-end="1272">Expand this to 10 pages</strong> (more math + theorems)<br data-start="1295" data-end="1298">
B. <strong data-start="1301" data-end="1333">Generate LaTeX source bundle</strong> (arXiv ready)<br data-start="1347" data-end="1350">
C. <strong data-start="1353" data-end="1393">Compile LaTeX to proper 2-column PDF</strong><br data-start="1393" data-end="1396">
D. <strong data-start="1399" data-end="1427">Add Lean proofs appendix</strong><br data-start="1427" data-end="1430">
E. <strong data-start="1433" data-end="1480">Add reference implementation (Python + WASM</strong>)<br data-start="1481" data-end="1484">
F. <strong data-start="1487" data-end="1505" data-is-only-node="">NeurIPS format</strong></p>
<p data-start="1507" data-end="1559">You can also say any combination, like: <code data-start="1547" data-end="1558">B + C + D</code>.</p>
