985" data-col-size="md">Temporal evolution &amp; phase transitions of semantics</td><td data-start="985" data-end="1035" data-col-size="md">Stability, phase bounds, attractor convergence</td></tr><tr data-start="1036" data-end="1230"><td data-start="1036" data-end="1080" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1038" data-end="1079">4. Realizability / proof theory first</strong></td><td data-start="1080" data-end="1133" data-col-size="md">Computability, normalization, Curry–Howard framing</td><td data-start="1133" data-end="1175" data-col-size="md">“Semantic proofs as runnable artifacts”</td><td data-start="1175" data-end="1230" data-col-size="md">Strong normalization, adequacy, realizability model</td></tr><tr data-start="1231" data-end="1434"><td data-start="1231" data-end="1275" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1233" data-end="1274">5. Algebraic information theory first</strong></td><td data-start="1275" data-end="1323" data-col-size="md">Entropy semirings, quantales, rate distortion</td><td data-start="1323" data-end="1377" data-col-size="md">Texture/time crystals, pricing, currency properties</td><td data-start="1377" data-end="1434" data-col-size="md">Conservation, entropy flow bounds, pricing equilibria</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 48.7031px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7