<h3 data-start="889" data-end="909"><strong data-start="893" data-end="909">2. Coherence</strong></h3>
<p data-start="910" data-end="1076"><strong data-start="910" data-end="960">Theorem 2 (Coherence of Semantic Composition).</strong><br data-start="960" data-end="963">
