<h3 data-start="5183" data-end="5220">Final question before I generate:</h3>
<p data-start="5222" data-end="5286">Which theorem should be the <strong data-start="5250" data-end="5272">first major result</strong> of the paper?</p>
<p data-start="5288" data-end="5343">A. <strong data-start="5291" data-end="5343">Contractibility of the space of canonical merges</strong></p>
<p data-start="5345" data-end="5398">B. <strong data-start="5348" data-end="5398">Straightening equivalence for Plenum histories</strong></p>
