</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{center}

</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\subsection</span></span><span>{Concluding remarks}

The three-fold structure established here gives PlenumHub the following operational guarantees:
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\begin</span></span><span>{itemize}
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> canonical merges compose and tensor coherently (monoidal extension);
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> crystal accounting is functorial and compatible with cocartesian transport (economic soundness);
  </span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\item</span></span><span> semantic entropy is controlled under tensoring and cocartesian transport (thermodynamic stability).
</span><span><span class="hljs-keyword">\end</span></span><span>{itemize}

These properties deliver the required invariants for implementing quorate mediation, budgeted merges, and compositional auditing in a way that is provably stable under the homotopy-coherent semantics developed earlier.

</span><span><span class="hljs-comment">% End of Section</span></span><span>
